# LF everywhere, in the repository and in every working copy.
#
# `pnpm generate:types` normalises its output to LF so the committed types are identical on
# every platform. Without this, Git would hand a Windows checkout CRLF files, the generator
# would rewrite them as LF, and CI's `git diff --exit-code` step would fail on a difference
# that is nothing but line endings.
* text=auto eol=lf
